 NOTE: This function **does not** understand multi-document sources, it throws
 exception on those.

Backport quadratic complexity fix for !!omap (GHSA-5p4m-2wfm-xmqj)

Duplicate-key detection for the `!!omap` YAML type used an Array plus a
linear `Array.prototype.indexOf` scan per element, giving O(n^2) behaviour
for a document with n distinct keys. A malicious document could exploit this
to cause denial of service via CPU exhaustion. Replace the linear scan with
an object used as a hash set so duplicate detection is O(1) per key.

